@ELFAssessment.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7143
@apiKey = elf-dev-api-key

### List breweries (default sort by name)
GET {{ELFAssessment.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Search and sort by city
GET {{ELFAssessment.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?search=micro&sortBy=City&sortDirection=Asc
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Sort by distance from an origin
GET {{ELFAssessment.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?sortBy=Distance&latitude=50.24&longitude=11.32
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get a single brewery
GET {{ELFAssessment.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries/ae7b3174-8be8-4d53-a3a5-9b8240970eea
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Autocomplete brewery names
GET {{ELFAssessment.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries/autocomplete?term=10&limit=5
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Missing API key (should return 401)
GET {{ELFAssessment.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries
Accept: application/json

